{
  "bundle": "demo",
  "content": "==> bundle.yaml <==\nschema_version: 4\nversion: 1.2.0\ndescription: demo bundle\ntags:\n  - sample\nauthor: someone\nnotes: human notes\nrequires:\n  commands:\n    - git\n\n==> fragments/dist.distilled.md <==\n---\ndistilled_by: claude-fast\n---\nshort form\n\n==> fragments/dist.md <==\n---\ntags: [distilled]\n---\nlong form of distilled\n\n==> fragments/example.md <==\n---\ntags:\n  - example\n  - house\n---\n\n# Example Fragment\n\nAdd your content here. Hello {{name}}.\n\n==> fragments/golang.md <==\n---\ndescription: when editing Go code\ntags: [go]\n---\nGO-RULES-BODY\n\n==> fragments/testing.md <==\n# testing\n\nFRAGMENT-BODY-testing\n\n==> hooks/pre_tool/.guard.meta.yaml <==\norder: 100\n\n==> hooks/pre_tool/guard.yaml <==\ncommand: echo\nargs: [guard]\ntool: shell\n\n==> mcp/.tree-sitter.meta.yaml <==\ntags:\n  - code\nnotes: parse trees\ninstallation: npm i tree-sitter\n\n==> mcp/remote.yaml <==\nurl: https://mcp.example.com/v1\nheaders:\n  X-Team: core\n\n==> mcp/tree-sitter.yaml <==\ncommand: tree-sitter\nargs:\n  - --stdio\nenv:\n  LOG: debug\n\n==> prompts/review.md <==\n---\ndescription: Review code\ntags: [review]\n---\nCOMMAND-BODY-review\n\n==> skills/.reviewer.meta.yaml <==\ntags:\n  - quality\nexecutable:\n  - scripts/run.sh\n\n==> skills/reviewer/SKILL.md <==\n---\nname: reviewer\ndescription: SKILL-MARKER\n---\n\n# reviewer\n\nbody\n\n==> skills/reviewer/scripts/run.sh <==\n#!/bin/sh\necho hi\n"
}